# EXPORT PLUGIN - a data set the export API hands out
#
#        one defined method is mandatory:
#        - Export(args)   returns <True|False>,<data>
#
# Loaded by the name the API was asked for, e.g. plugins/export/prometheus.py,
# and only when that name is listed in ALLOWED_EXPORTERS under [PLUGINS] in
# luna.ini. There is no search path and no default.
